<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kricaa zaehoikung kacoehta mah Loktang ah palung ih, qoih ih nongpata hoi a caanawk khae khue ai ah, Loktang panoek kaminawk boih khaeah doeh ca tarik;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />aicae thung kaom aicae hoi dungzan ah kaom hankoi, loktang lok pongah ni kang palung o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Sithaw hoi Ampa Sithaw, Angraeng Jesu Kri hoi Ampa ih Capa khae hoiah tahmenhaih, palungnathaih hoi monghaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ampa khae hoiah kaalok a hnuk o baktih toengah, na caanawk loktang loklam ah caeh o ti, tiah ka panoek naah paroeai anghoehaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nongpata, vaihi nangcae khaeah kaalok kangtha ka tarik ai, tangsuek natuem hoi a tawnh o ih kaalok to ni ka tarik, maeto hoi maeto amlunghaih a tawnh o thai hanah kang pacae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anih mah peek ih kaalok baktiah caehhaih loe amlunghaih ah oh. Kaalok pazui hanah tangsuek na hoiah na thaih o boeh, kaalok loe to tiah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jesu Kri loe taksa ah angzoh, tiah taphong ai, aling thaih paroeai kaminawk long ah akun o boeh. To baktih kami loe aling thaih kami hoi Kri ih misa ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sak o ih hmuennawk pathlong ving kami na ai, hnuk hankoi tangqum to a hnuk o thai hanah, acoehaih hoiah zing oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kri patukhaih pongah om ai ah zaehaih sah kami loe, Sithaw tawn ai kami ni. Kri patukhaih thungah om kami loe, Ampa hoi Capa to tawnh hmaek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hae patukhaih tawn ai kami nangcae khaeah angzo nahaeloe, im ah toem o sak hmah, talawk doeh talawk o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To baktih talawk kami loe kahoih ai anih toksakhaih bomkung ah ni oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah ca zetpui tarik han ka tawnh, toe caqam hoi catui patoh moe, tarik han ka koeh ai: aicae anghoehaih akoep thai hanah, nangcae khaeah kang zoh moe, mikhmai kang tongah lokthuih han oephaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na qoih ih nam nawk nongpata ih caanawk mah ban angsin o. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
